# OpenAI

## Supported Models

- [x] [chatGPT](https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/chat/introduction)
- [x] [GPT-3.5-turbo](https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/gpt/gpt-35-turbo)
- [x] [GPT-4](https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/gpt/gpt-4)
- [x] [DALL-E](https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/images/introduction)
- [x] [Whisper](https://platform.openai.com/whisper)

## Usage

### ChatGPT 4

```typescript
import { OpenAI } from "https://deno.land/x/openai/mod.ts";

const openai = new OpenAI("YOUR_API_KEY");

const response = await openai.chat.completions.create({
  model: "gpt-4-0613",
  messages: [
    { role: "system", content: "You are a helpful assistant." },
    { role: "user", content: "What is Deno?" },
  ],
});

console.log(response.choices[0].message.content);
```

### ChatGPT 3.5

```typescript
import { OpenAI } from "https://deno.land/x/openai/mod.ts";

const openai = new OpenAI("YOUR_API_KEY");

const response = await openai.chat.completions.create({
  model: "gpt-3.5-turbo",
  messages: [
    { role: "system", content: "You are a helpful assistant." },
    { role: "user", content: "What is Deno?" },
  ],
});

console.log(response.choices[0].message.content);
```

### Whisper

```typescript
import { OpenAI } from "https://deno.land/x/openai/mod.ts";

const openai = new OpenAI("YOUR_API_KEY");

const response = await openai.audio.transcriptions.create(
  "https://example.com/audio.mp3",
  "whisper-1",
  {
    prompt: "transcribe this audio",
  },
);

console.log(response.text);
```

### DALL-E

```typescript
import { OpenAI } from "https://deno.land/x/openai/mod.ts";

const openai = new OpenAI("YOUR_API_KEY");

const response = await openai.images.generate({
  prompt: "A cute baby sea otter",
  n: 1,
  size: "256x256",
});

console.log(response.data[0].url);
```

## API Reference

### ChatGPT

```typescript
import { OpenAI } from "https://deno.land/x/openai/mod.ts";

const openai = new OpenAI("YOUR_API_KEY");

const response = await openai.chat.completions.create({
  model: "gpt-4-0613",
  messages: [
    {
      role: "system",
      content: "You are a helpful assistant.",
    },
    {
      role: "user",
      content: "What is Deno?",
    },
  ],
  max_tokens: 100,
});

console.log(response.choices[0].message.content);
```

- model (string): The model to use for completion. Defaults to `gpt-4-0613`.
- messages (array): A list of messages to send to the model.
- max_tokens (number): The maximum number of tokens to generate. Defaults to `1000`.

#### Message

```typescript
{
  role: "system" | "user" | "assistant",
  content: string,
}
```

### Whisper

```typescript
import { OpenAI } from "https://deno.land/x/openai/mod.ts";

const openai = new OpenAI("YOUR_API_KEY");

const response = await openai.audio.transcriptions.create(
  "https://example.com/audio.mp3",
  "whisper-1",
  {
    prompt: "transcribe this audio",
    response_format: "json",
  },
);

console.log(response.text);
```

- audio (string): The audio to transcribe.
- model (string): The model to use for transcription. Defaults to `whisper-1`.
- prompt (string): An optional prompt to give the model.
- response_format (string): The format of the response. Defaults to `text`.

### DALL-E

```typescript
import { OpenAI } from "https://deno.land/x/openai/mod.ts";

