# Qwen

Qwen is a chatbot created by Alibaba Cloud.

## Features

- AI-powered chatbot
- Natural language processing
- Interactive chat interface

## Demo

![Qwen Demo](qwen_demo.png)

## Installation

1. Clone the repository:
```
git clone https://github.com/alibabacloud/Qwen.git
```

2. Install dependencies:
```
cd Qwen
npm install
```

3. Start the server:
```
npm start
```

## Usage

Open your browser and navigate to `http://localhost:3000` to start chatting with Qwen.

## Contributing

We welcome contributions from the community. If you'd like to contribute, please fork the repository and submit a pull request. Make sure to follow the code style and guidelines.

## License

This project is licensed under the MIT License. See the `LICENSE` file for details.

## Contact

For any questions or concerns, please contact us at [developer-support@aliyun.com](mailto:developer-support@aliyun.com).

## Acknowledgments

- Special thanks to the Alibaba Cloud team for providing the necessary tools and resources to create Qwen.
- We would like to acknowledge the contributions of the OpenAI team for their research and development on natural language processing.
- Thanks to the developers of the Node.js and React libraries, which made this project possible.

## References

- [Alibaba Cloud Documentation](https://developer.aliyun.com/)
- [Node.js Documentation](https://nodejs.org/en/docs/)
- [React Documentation](https://reactjs.org/docs/getting-started.html)
- [OpenAI Documentation](https://openai.com/docs/)

## Disclaimer

Qwen is a chatbot created by Alibaba Cloud for educational purposes. It is not intended for c<|fim_suffix|>ns and is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind.

