# Qwen

[<img alt="Go Reference" src="https://pkg.go.dev/badge/github.com/alibaba/Qwen.svg" />](https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/alibaba/Qwen)

Qwen is an open-source LLM (Large Language Model) based on [Alibaba DAMO Academy](https://damo.alibaba.com/)'s [M6](https://www.m6.ai/) technology. Qwen is a highly efficient, large-scale, multi-modal language model optimized for industrial scenarios, with a focus on stream-oriented inference, zero-shot inference, and multi-modal generation capabilities.

## Documentation

We have detailed documentation for Qwen on [GitHub Wiki](https://github.com/alibaba/Qwen/wiki). You can find information about model training, inference, and other topics there.

## Community

For discussions and collaboration, please visit our [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/alibaba/Qwen/discussions).

## License

Qwen is licensed under the [Apache License, Version 2.0](https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

