# AnimeBot

## Features

### Anime Info
Get information about an anime by providing its name.

```
Usage: anime [anime-name]
Example: anime Naruto
```

### Anime Quotes
Get quotes from an anime by providing its name.

```
Usage: animequote [anime-name]
Example: animequote Naruto
```

### Pokemon Info
Get information about a Pokémon by providing its name or ID.

```
Usage: pokemon [pokemon-name|id]
Example: pokemon Pikachu or pokemon 1
```

### Anime Quotes
Get quotes from an anime by providing its name.

```
Usage: animequote [anime-name]
Example: animequote Naruto
```

### Ping
Check the ping of the bot.

```
Usage: ping
Example: ping
```

### Audio
Play audio from a file in a voice channel.

```
Usage: audio <file>
Example: audio example.mp3
```

### Quote Generator
Generate a quote using the Qwen model.

```
Usage: quote <text>
Example: quote "The world is your oyster."
```

### Image
Generate an image using the Qwen model.

```
Usage: image <text>
Example: image "A beautiful sunset."
```

### Text Generator
Generate text using the Qwen model.

```
Usage: text <text>
Example: text "Once upon a time,"
```

### Chat
Have a conversation with the Qwen model.

```
Usage: chat <text>
Example: chat "Hello, how are you?"
```

### Help
Get help on the available commands.

```
Usage: help
Example: help
```

### AFK
Set your status as AFK.

```
Usage: afk <reason>
Example: afk busy
```

### AFK Remove
Remove your AFK status.

```
Usage: afkremove
Example: afkremove
```

### AFK List
Get the list of AFK users.

```
Usage: afklist
Example: afklist
```

### Prefix
Change the prefix for the bot.

```
Usage: prefix <new-prefix>
Example: prefix !
```

### Leave
Leave the voice channel where the bot is currently connected.

```
Usage: leave
Example: leave
```

### Server Info
Get information about the server.

```
Usage: serverinfo
Example: serverinfo
```

### Server Invite
Get the invite link for the server.

```
Usage: serverinvite
Example: serverinvite
```

### Server Members
Get the list of members in the server.

```
Usage: servermembers
Example: servermembers
```

### Server Roles
Get the list of roles in the server.

```
Usage: serverroles
Example: serverroles
```

### Server Channels
Get the list of channels in the server.

```
Usage: serverchannels
Example: serverchannels
```

### Server Guild
Get the guild ID of the server.

```
Usage: serverguild
Example: serverguild
```

### Server Owner
Get the owner of the server.

```
Usage: serverowner
