# DALL-E Quickstart

This project contains a simple Flask app that generates images from text prompts using the [DALL-E API](https://openai.com/blog/dall-e/).

To run the app, first make sure you have [Flask](https://flask.palletsprojects.com/en/2.2.x/) installed. Then, set your OpenAI API key in the `config.py` file and run `python app.py`. You can then access the app at [http://localhost:5000](http://localhost:5000).

![DALL-E Quickstart app screenshot](screenshot.png)
