# Qwen Security Check
This repo is used to protect Qwen security.

## Usage
```
python -m security_check --dir /path/to/qwen --repo https://github.com/ --user qwen --password xxxxxxxx --token xxxxxxxx
```

## Update
```
python -m security_check --dir /path/to/qwen --repo https://github.com/ --user qwen --password xxxxxxxx --token xxxxxxxx --update
```

## Options
```
-d, --dir: The directory to check, default is current directory
-r, --repo: The repository url, default is https://github.com/
-u, --user: The username to access the repository
-p, --password: The password or personal access token to access the repository
-t, --token: The GitHub API token
--update: Update security check
```

## Report
```
python -m security_check --dir /path/to/qwen --repo https://github.com/ --user qwen --password xxxxxxxx --token xxxxxxxx --report
```

## Report Options
```
--dir: The directory to report, default is current directory
--repo: The repository url, default is https://github.com/
--user: The username to access the repository
--password: The password or personal access token to access the repository
--token: The GitHub API token
--update: Update security check
--report: Report security check
```

## Report Format
```
{
    "verdict": "ALLOWED",
    "reason": "No issues found",
    "rules": [
        {
            "name": "Security Check",
            "description": "This rule checks for security issues in the codebase.",
            "severity": "LOW",
            "status": "PASSED",
            "details": "No issues found"
        }
    ]
}
```

## Update Rules
```
python -m security_check --dir /path/to/qwen --repo https://github.com/ --user qwen --password xxxxxxxx --token xxxxxxxx --update
```

## Update Rules Options
```
--dir: The directory to update, default is current directory
--repo: The repository url, default is https://github.com/
--user: The username to access the repository
--password: The password or personal access token to access the repository
--token: The GitHub API token
--update: Update security check
```

## Update Rules Format
```
{
    "security_check": {
        "description": "This rule checks for security issues in the codebase.",
        "severity": "LOW",
        "status": "PASSED",
        "details": "No issues found"
    }
}
```

