# Qwen

Qwen is an open source AI chatbot. It is based on Qwen-7B, a pre-trained LLaMA model developed by Alibaba Cloud.

## Features

- Zero shot reasoning on a wide range of topics
- Ability to generate code snippets
- Ability to generate images

## Setup

1. Clone the repository
2. Install the dependencies
3. Run the app

```bash
git clone https://github.com/AI-UX-Eng/ml-frontend.git
cd ml-frontend
npm install
npm start
```

## License

MIT
